WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.424 --> 00:00:04.647
Unit twenty-four. How Voice Assistants Work!

2
00:00:05.563 --> 00:00:10.526
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:10.576 --> 00:00:13.898
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.948 --> 00:00:18.466
Today we learn about How Voice Assistants Work. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:25.087
Voice assistant. Say it with me. Voice assistant!

6
00:00:28.585 --> 00:00:32.636
Wake word. Say it with me. Wake word!

7
00:00:36.167 --> 00:00:40.167
Speech. Say it with me. Speech!

8
00:00:43.587 --> 00:00:47.418
Text. Say it with me. Text!

9
00:00:50.975 --> 00:00:54.794
Internet. Say it with me. Internet!

10
00:00:58.297 --> 00:01:02.163
Answer. Say it with me. Answer!

11
00:01:05.603 --> 00:01:09.561
Privacy. Say it with me. Privacy!

12
00:01:13.093 --> 00:01:17.276
Microphone. Say it with me. Microphone!

13
00:01:20.788 --> 00:01:33.829
A voice assistant listens for a wake word through a microphone. It turns speech into text, sends it over the internet, and gives an answer. I think about privacy when devices are listening.

14
00:01:33.879 --> 00:01:37.507
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:38.502 --> 00:01:44.068
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:44.118 --> 00:01:45.268
Speech!

17
00:01:46.230 --> 00:01:51.647
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:51.697 --> 00:01:52.847
Privacy!

19
00:01:54.014 --> 00:02:00.045
Did you know? Most voice assistants only start recording after they hear their wake word!

20
00:02:00.095 --> 00:02:02.324
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:03.311 --> 00:02:12.446
Think and answer. What privacy questions do voice assistants raise?

22
00:02:12.496 --> 00:02:13.710
Great answer!

23
00:02:14.681 --> 00:02:20.366
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:20.416 --> 00:02:23.411
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

